        "c92a6fe3-7b42-4934-b4ef-7a1fec7517d1": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 900,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 180,
            "content": "## Polling trigger\n\nThe trigger polls every minute and its first tick only records where it starts. The flow waits 2 minutes, then creates the record the trigger must report on a later tick; a Condition keeps only the record of this run. AfterAll timeout is 420 s. Do not remove the Wait."
